# Never commit personal data to a public repository.
#
# Note: a bare pattern like `profile.md` matches at ANY depth, so the blank
# template under templates/ must be re-included by name, after the rule above
# it. Order matters in .gitignore — the last matching pattern wins.
profile.md
log/
reports/
photos/

# The blank templates and the fabricated fixtures are part of the repo.
# Your filled-in data is not.
!templates/
!templates/profile.md
!examples/
